<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1824713159"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1551613734"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Chaos Drifters"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Jean-Ken Johnny / SawanoHiroyuki[nZk]"/><amll:meta key="album" value="iv"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:48.308"><div begin="00:31.403" end="03:48.308"><p begin="00:31.403" end="00:34.930" itunes:key="L1">Wanna know what's out there 錆びた声 軋ませ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想知道外面发生了什么</span></p><p begin="00:35.302" end="00:38.877" itunes:key="L36">Am I meant for something? 歯車が意味を欲しがる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的出现是否具有别样的意义</span></p><p begin="00:39.203" end="00:42.918" itunes:key="L37">幾たびも 見た夢は 等しく醒めて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那反复重现的梦境总是会醒来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ku ta bi mo mi ta yu me wa hi to shi ku sa me te</span></p><p begin="00:43.153" end="00:46.322" itunes:key="L2">救われぬ お祈りを 捧げる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只好不断献上不得救赎的祈祷</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su ku wa re nu o i no ri wo sa sa ge ru</span></p><p begin="00:47.191" end="00:50.327" itunes:key="L3">So my friend light the fire here<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以 我的朋友 点燃火焰</span></p><p begin="00:50.409" end="00:54.346" itunes:key="L4">Light the fire here to find your answer<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">点燃火焰 寻找你的答案</span></p><p begin="00:54.356" end="00:59.015" itunes:key="L5">Light the fire here Yes Light your fire here for me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">点燃火焰 点燃你心中的火焰</span></p><p begin="01:00.908" end="01:02.457" itunes:key="L6">And give it away<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">散发光芒</span></p><p begin="01:02.657" end="01:06.263" itunes:key="L7">欠けているこの世界で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在这残破不堪的世界之中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ke te i ru ko no se ka i de</span></p><p begin="01:06.582" end="01:10.187" itunes:key="L8">ありもしない理想追いかけて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">追逐着根本不存在的理想</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ri mo shi na i ri so u o i ka ke te</span></p><p begin="01:10.486" end="01:14.050" itunes:key="L9">Pull the trigger you Chaos Drifters<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">扣动扳机吧 你这个茫然的漂泊者</span></p><p begin="01:14.357" end="01:18.025" itunes:key="L10">抗うように 願い込めて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心怀期许 和这个世界正面对抗</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ra ga u yo u ni ne ga i ko me te</span></p><p begin="01:18.035" end="01:19.940" itunes:key="L11">What do I want and what will I see?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想要什么 我会看到什么</span></p><p begin="01:19.950" end="01:21.895" itunes:key="L38">Keep on point the gun in my head<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">继续把枪口对准我的头颅</span></p><p begin="01:21.909" end="01:23.810" itunes:key="L39">What do I want and what will I seek?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想要什么 我会找到什么</span></p><p begin="01:23.849" end="01:25.771" itunes:key="L40">Ain't nobody spoil it to me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">谁都无法破坏我的信仰</span></p><p begin="01:25.782" end="01:27.732" itunes:key="L12">What did I want and what did I see?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想要什么 我看到了什么</span></p><p begin="01:27.752" end="01:29.689" itunes:key="L41">Keep on point the gun in my head<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">继续把枪口对准我的头颅</span></p><p begin="01:29.699" end="01:31.577" itunes:key="L42">What do I want and what will I seek?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想要什么 我会找到什么</span></p><p begin="01:31.658" end="01:33.622" itunes:key="L43">Burn that riddle till the last scene<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不断探寻那个谜 直到最后一刻</span></p><p begin="01:41.700" end="01:45.389" itunes:key="L13">Do we have a shelter? 選ばれなかった僕らでも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们是否还有容身之处</span></p><p begin="01:45.580" end="01:49.130" itunes:key="L14">We believe in something 朧な光に焦がれる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心中也仍旧怀有信仰</span></p><p begin="01:49.504" end="01:53.129" itunes:key="L15">白と黒 混ぜすぎの 灰色の世界<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在这黑白交融是非难辨的灰暗世界</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi ro to ku ro ma ze su gi no ha i i ro no se ka i</span></p><p begin="01:53.304" end="01:56.612" itunes:key="L16">少しでも 真っさらな 瞬間を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕仅片刻一瞬也希望能迎来重生</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su ko shi de mo ma 's sa ra na shu n ka n wo</span></p><p begin="01:57.506" end="02:00.437" itunes:key="L17">So my friend light the fire here<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以 我的朋友 点燃火焰</span></p><p begin="02:00.447" end="02:04.627" itunes:key="L18">Just light the fire here to find your answer<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">点燃火焰 寻找你的答案</span></p><p begin="02:04.632" end="02:09.418" itunes:key="L19">Light the fire here Yes Light your fire here for thee. . .<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">点燃火焰 点燃你心中的火焰</span></p><p begin="02:11.133" end="02:12.669" itunes:key="L20">To give it away<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">释放光芒</span></p><p begin="02:12.954" end="02:16.522" itunes:key="L21">As I swallow the lies in vanity<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我在虚空中吞噬所有谎言</span></p><p begin="02:16.808" end="02:20.446" itunes:key="L22">吐き出して浄化するように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再倾吐而出 让心灵回归最初的澄净</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha ki da shi te jo u ka su ru yo u ni</span></p><p begin="02:20.707" end="02:24.326" itunes:key="L23">Pull the trigger you Chaos Drifters<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">扣动扳机吧 你这个茫然的漂泊者</span></p><p begin="02:24.602" end="02:28.289" itunes:key="L24">心のまま 撃ちつくして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">随心所欲地歼灭所有目标</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko ro no ma ma u chi tsu ku shi te</span></p><p begin="02:28.299" end="02:30.189" itunes:key="L25">What do I want and what will I see?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想要什么 我会看到什么</span></p><p begin="02:30.199" end="02:32.144" itunes:key="L44">Keep on point the gun in my head<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">继续把枪口对准我的头颅</span></p><p begin="02:32.150" end="02:34.088" itunes:key="L45">What do I want and what will I seek?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想要什么 我会找到什么</span></p><p begin="02:34.100" end="02:36.032" itunes:key="L46">Ain't nobody spoil it to me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">谁都无法破坏我的信仰</span></p><p begin="02:36.042" end="02:37.987" itunes:key="L26">What did I want and what did I see?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想要什么 我看到了什么</span></p><p begin="02:38.001" end="02:39.937" itunes:key="L47">Keep on point the gun in my head<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">继续把枪口对准我的头颅</span></p><p begin="02:39.957" end="02:41.864" itunes:key="L48">What do I want and what will I seek?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想要什么 我会找到什么</span></p><p begin="02:41.902" end="02:43.930" itunes:key="L49">Burn that riddle till the last scene<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不断探寻那个谜 直到最后一刻</span></p><p begin="02:59.908" end="03:01.518" itunes:key="L27">Just give it away<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">释放光芒</span></p><p begin="03:01.700" end="03:05.319" itunes:key="L28">欠けているこの世界で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在这残破不堪的世界之中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ke te i ru ko no se ka i de</span></p><p begin="03:05.600" end="03:09.217" itunes:key="L29">ありもしない理想追いかけて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">追逐着根本不存在的理想</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ri mo shi na i ri so u o i ka ke te</span></p><p begin="03:09.451" end="03:13.054" itunes:key="L30">Pull the trigger you Chaos Drifters<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">扣动扳机吧 你这个茫然的漂泊者</span></p><p begin="03:13.357" end="03:17.043" itunes:key="L31">抗うように 意志を込めて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">意志坚定 和这个世界正面对抗</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ra ga u yo u ni i shi wo ko me te</span></p><p begin="03:17.053" end="03:18.944" itunes:key="L32">What do I want and what will I see?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想要什么 我会看到什么</span></p><p begin="03:18.954" end="03:20.924" itunes:key="L50">Keep on point the gun in my head<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">继续把枪口对准我的头颅</span></p><p begin="03:20.949" end="03:22.850" itunes:key="L51">What do I want and what will I seek?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想要什么 我会找到什么</span></p><p begin="03:22.887" end="03:24.794" itunes:key="L52">Ain't nobody spoil it to me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">谁都无法破坏我的信仰</span></p><p begin="03:24.804" end="03:26.741" itunes:key="L33">What did I want and what did I see?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想要什么 我看到了什么</span></p><p begin="03:26.751" end="03:28.726" itunes:key="L53">Keep on point the gun in my head<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">继续把枪口对准我的头颅</span></p><p begin="03:28.749" end="03:30.650" itunes:key="L54">What do I want and what will I seek?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想要什么 我会找到什么</span></p><p begin="03:30.658" end="03:32.620" itunes:key="L55">Burn that riddle till the last scene<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不断探寻那个谜 直到最后一刻</span></p><p begin="03:32.652" end="03:34.544" itunes:key="L34">What do I want and what will I see?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想要什么 我会看到什么</span></p><p begin="03:34.554" end="03:36.537" itunes:key="L56">Keep on point the gun in my head<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">继续把枪口对准我的头颅</span></p><p begin="03:36.547" end="03:38.440" itunes:key="L57">What do I want and what will I seek?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想要什么 我会找到什么</span></p><p begin="03:38.450" end="03:40.395" itunes:key="L58">Count my steps till the 13th<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">细数我的脚步 直到第十三步</span></p><p begin="03:40.405" end="03:42.346" itunes:key="L35">What did I want and what did I see?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想要什么 我看到了什么</span></p><p begin="03:42.356" end="03:44.339" itunes:key="L59">Keep on point the gun in my head<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">继续把枪口对准我的头颅</span></p><p begin="03:44.349" end="03:46.245" itunes:key="L60">What do I want and what will I seek?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想要什么 我会找到什么</span></p><p begin="03:46.255" end="03:48.308" itunes:key="L61">Burn that riddle till the last scene<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不断探寻那个谜 直到最后一刻</span></p></div></body></tt>